+ see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280189060,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79786,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63dd48d3470ef6efca383272765fd5ef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey Brides!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Since this is a month of giving, I am&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;planning on &amp;nbsp;hosting a webinar for you \"Brides\", who are looking to get married in a resort and are just looking for support not a wedding planner.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;In this webinar, you will learn the following:&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;How to know which resort to book?&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Where are you in your planning?&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Is there anything such as the \u201cperfect\u201d wedding package?&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;\u201cHelp! I\u00b4ve just gotten started and I\u00b4m already going crazy!\u201d&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;How to have a beautiful destination wedding&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;(while keeping the travel costs under control)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;If this is something you would want to join, please leave a comment&amp;nbsp;below. Also let me know the best time to host it for you.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Joyce&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908224,"PostDate":1449566677,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey Brides!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since this is a month of giving, I am<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0planning on \u00a0hosting a webinar for you \"Brides\", who are looking to get married in a resort and are just looking for support not a wedding planner.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">In this webinar, you will learn the following:<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">How to know which resort to book?<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Where are you in your planning?<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Is there anything such as the \u201cperfect\u201d wedding package?<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u201cHelp! I\u00b4ve just gotten started and I\u00b4m already going crazy!\u201d<\/span><br><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">How to have a beautiful destination wedding<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">(while keeping the travel costs under control)<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span>If this is something you would want to join, please leave a comment\u00a0below. Also let me know the best time to host it for you.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Joyce<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326832787,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.50.15.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79786,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75ac1bd0161ac7ba7759fcc4d373708e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;To all you brides to be: I&#039;m really behind in my reviews, one of which is Joyce of Dream Weddings. Joyce was absolutely wonderful during my planning for our vow renewal, even when I got a little nervous nutsy!!&amp;nbsp; She was a calming voice of reason when things were going wrong for us.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can definitely count on her webinar to be of value to all of you that are in the early stages of your planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!! Go Joyce!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908246,"PostDate":1449617047,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>To all you brides to be: I'm really behind in my reviews, one of which is Joyce of Dream Weddings. Joyce was absolutely wonderful during my planning for our vow renewal, even when I got a little nervous nutsy!!\u00a0 She was a calming voice of reason when things were going wrong for us.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can definitely count on her webinar to be of value to all of you that are in the early stages of your planning!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!! Go Joyce!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/ann.chadwick.5\/media_set?set=a.10153262834771016.1073741828.569791015&type=3<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/'><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78874-acw271011-so-this-is-not-a-planning-thread-but\/<\/em><\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283437399,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"190.167.178.190","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79786,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Moments That Matter, 11 December 2015 - 11:13 AM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1449832439,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1d837e44cffdc25a782494d4edbdbbb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great endorsement, acw271011, and we certainly concur - Joyce Rocks!!! Hope all you busy brides are able to let her help you out and take some of your workload off your shoulders......cheers!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....here&#039;s a wee gem to inspire you on your way....taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Cover Photos Album &lt;\/a&gt;- enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xlt1\/t31.0-8\/12304126_10153785339774487_6948717609887949276_o.jpg\" alt=\"12304126_10153785339774487_6948717609887\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908308,"PostDate":1449832378,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great endorsement, acw271011, and we certainly concur - Joyce Rocks!!! Hope all you busy brides are able to let her help you out and take some of your workload off your shoulders......cheers!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....here's a wee gem to inspire you on your way....taken from our <a href='https:\